commit ef2a5f25287b255dac75635db41692a5b4d5ed11

C03: the App accepts a countdown final without the literal clock (CLOCK1335)

CLOCK1333 measured: the mind composed and published «Faltan 13 horas y 43 minutos para las 3 de la tarde.» and the App rejected it three times with missing_literal_fact, because UserMessagePolicy demands the observed time literally in every system.time final. For a countdown request («cuánto falta para…», «how long until…») the final answers with the remaining time: the observed clock is optional there and the asked time is not an invented extra clock. Every other check of the policy is unchanged.

App recompiled (BUILD1335). Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


